window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Things start to get even more complicated for the new Dragon Empress in the conclusion to this epic Dragon Fantasy romance!</i></b><br> <br> I manage to escape the clutches of my supposed Fae mate, by using my sister as a diversion, but once I get back home, things start to move rapidly with my pregnancy. However, with this glorious Christmas gift, a new set of problems arise.<br> <br> After discovering who the father of my daughter is, we have the consequences to deal with. Not only within our relationship but the far-reaching ones. On top of that, I'm still finding my feet being Empress of the most powerful race -- the Dragons, and yet my Fae mate won't leave me alone. I have to find a way to make all of this work without hurting my men and the most precious thing to me, my daughter.<br> <br> On top of that, the repercussions of finding out about my own father are severe, leaving me doubting who I am but it soon becomes clear there is only one solution.<br> <br> This isn't going to be as easy as I first thought.<br> <br> Dragon RH series. Scenes of MM. Possible triggers.</p>"; 
